# Socket-direct ConnectX-8, bandwidth (run.sh epyc-sd platform), since
# 2026-10-28: epyc-sp5's ConnectX-8 with both Gen5 x16 links, port 1 fed by
# server1's two ConnectX-7 through the MikroTik (400G optics), port 0 by
# server1's BlueField-3 over a DAC.  Stages are name:gen-ports[:frame[:rate]].
# The packet-rate twin is epyc-sd-pps.
DUT=epyc-sd
GEN=server1
CALIBRATE=1
DUT_KIND=host
PLATFORM_STAGES="${PLATFORM_STAGES:-p1-1500:0,1:1500 p0-1500:2:1500 both-1500:0,1,2:1500 both-64:0,1,2:64}"
PLATFORM_TOPOLOGY="${PLATFORM_TOPOLOGY:-server1 (TRex): ConnectX-7 #1 and #2 at 200G through a MikroTik switch into ConnectX-8 port 1 (400G optics), BlueField-3 port 0 (NIC mode, PCIe Gen4) by DAC into ConnectX-8 port 0 (400G); the ConnectX-8 runs socket direct, two PCIe Gen5 x16 functions per port, and each generator port alternates between the two functions of its DUT port; every DUT port is an ingress and drops everything}"
